# VERBATIM data block data_3 from CCDC deposition 1814452 (CCDC Access Structures, downloaded by the user), cited in 10.1021/acs.jpca.3c02543 CCDC 1814452
# Complex 4 [Ni(dmbpy)(H2O)2Br2] (DOFNUK); formula C12H16Br2N2NiO2. SI Table S4 cites CCDC 1814452 for this complex, and it is a literature structure that the paper reuses rather than deposits. The CIF has one Ni site. Paper: 'Calculations were done in the experimental geometry of the complex unit' (not optimised); only the complex unit was computed, while the CIF holds the whole crystal.; crystal formula C12 H16 Br2 N2 Ni O2. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised. Embedded reflection data omitted.
